  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pathways to Peace (P2P): A Capacity Building Journey for Youth Peacebuilding Civic Actors in Kurdistan Region of Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project aims to support youth-led civil society organisations strengthen their leadership, organisational and technical capacities to enhance inclusive youth participation in peacebuilding initiatives and promote a culture of peace and respect. It also aims at bringing these CSOs to advocate for an inclusive and gender-sensitive peace dialogue with local and regional authorities.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
